Source app.py: https://huggingface.co/spaces/hemil124/virtual-tryon/blob/29f4ad42a29af63c71a7bc9e53ea7cd5342694c1/app.py
The Space includes Apache License 2.0 (included in licenses/Apache-2.0.txt).
Local modifications: project-local offline cache and explicit weight setup,
loopback launch/port options, input/resource limits, existing WEBP examples,
and corrected timing/quality hints plus omission of unused imports.
CPU single-pass inference is retained. The UI uses Gradio 6.13.0 and adds a
CPU/CUDA selector with serialized switching and single-pipeline caching.
tryon/sampling.py adapts the upstream Euler/CFG sampler at the FASHN revision
below; its sole numerical change is to generate initial noise on CPU in
FP32 before casting to the GPU's inference dtype. Model weights are unchanged.
The former local hand/face repair, inpainting and comparison code is removed.

